The separate Rust control bridge, build recipe, and original documentation are
licensed GPL-2.0-or-later, the project default.

The supported build applies patches/0001-add-emucap-joystick-override.patch and
patches/0002-add-emucap-vdp-frame-probe.patch to openMSX 21.0. The modified
MSXMotherBoard, JoystickPort, and VDP source/header files carry no separate
license notice. The openMSX release README assigns such files to the GNU GPL
text in doc/GPL.txt, which is version 2, but does not state an unambiguous
"or later" permission in the project grant. emucap therefore handles the patch
files and a combined patched host conservatively at the GPL-2.0-only upstream
boundary. Separately authored bridge and build code remains
GPL-2.0-or-later; both grants can be satisfied under GPLv2 when used together.

The openMSX source package includes C-BIOS machine ROMs under the BSD
2-Clause license. Their original copyright, license, and disclaimer remain
authoritative and must accompany any redistribution.

This repository distributes the two patch files and a source-build recipe, but
not the openMSX source tree or binaries, C-BIOS binaries, proprietary MSX system
ROMs, or game media. See ../../NOTICE.

